omers and earns a lot of money for herself. However, she has yet to truly experience the taste of love, so she always looks forward to meeting a lover worthy of everything she has to offer.\nPlease draw her in your anime art style. Pose or expression is up to you! Thank you for reading my skeb. I really appreciate your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12MEPJHdH7noWePMQncbi0dNMtu3OPh5Z", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xux_679/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3281799, "client_id": 3276002, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/631aa5cb/uploads/origins/ac30e94a-aae5-42b0-a4c1-995eb3d28039?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb23c4f587ccbbf37e0f6206e7b2d39", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/631aa5cb/uploads/origins/ac30e94a-aae5-42b0-a4c1-995eb3d28039?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb23c4f587ccbbf37e0f6206e7b2d39, https://si.imgix.net/631aa5cb/uploads/origins/ac30e94a-aae5-42b0-a4c1-995eb3d28039?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2ebdfcc85f3c13c4fc0d60d05a47737 2x, https://si.imgix.net/631aa5cb/uploads/origins/ac30e94a-aae5-42b0-a4c1-995eb3d28039?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=281178e40843f2e6aecbccc83eb12ef5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/631aa5cb/uploads/origins/ac30e94a-aae5-42b0-a4c1-995eb3d28039?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d0bfe3dc5020c548e9a3a9a700bc59d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/631aa5cb/uploads/origins/ac30e94a-aae5-42b0-a4c1-995eb3d28039?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d0bfe3dc5020c548e9a3a